# Name reactions (T-148): villagers react to well-known farm and player names (a joke, a placeholder, a place). Each plays once, in the reaction band (priority 3),
# the next time the named villager is talked to. The atoms are farmname:<name> and playername:<name> (case-insensitive, underscore for a space).
# Other names get no special line; the ordinary talk pool already uses [farm].

addto npc.tilda.talk
3 farmname:sunnyside => tilda.namefarm.sunnyside cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Sunnyside. A good name and a good promise. I'll put the sign in the window.
3 farmname:green_acres => tilda.namefarm.green_acres cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Green Acres. A lovely name and a lovely hope. Let's both aim for the second.
3 farmname:home => tilda.namefarm.home cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Just 'Home'. Oh. That's the nicest farm name in the valley, and I sell seeds for a living.
3 farmname:maple => tilda.namefarm.maple cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Maple. Warm, sticky and sweet in fall. A farm name with a good pantry.
3 farmname:wetherell => tilda.namefarm.wetherell cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Wetherell! Naming it after the village. I'll put it on the slate as 'Loyal'.
3 farmname:farm => tilda.namefarm.farm cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Just 'Farm'. Bold. Minimal. I'll put it on the slate as 'Farm (Honest)'.
3 farmname:farmville => tilda.namefarm.farmville cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Farmville. A bit on the nose, dear, but the nose is a good one.
3 farmname:parsnip_palace => tilda.namefarm.parsnip_palace cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Parsnip Palace. Parsnips are the sensible king of the garden. I'll stock a crown.
3 farmname:pumpkin => tilda.namefarm.pumpkin cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Pumpkin! Round, orange and very prize-worthy. I'll put your name in the window.
3 farmname:pie => tilda.namefarm.pie cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Pie. There's a feud brewing in this village over that very word. You've picked a side. I admire it.
3 farmname:cozy_corner => tilda.namefarm.cozy_corner cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Cozy Corner. I'm borrowing that for the back of the shop. I'll put you on the slate for it.
3 farmname:default => tilda.namefarm.default cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Default. Practical, dear. I'll update the slate to 'Default (Sensible)'.
3 playername:farmer => tilda.nameplayer.farmer cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Farmer. Ha. The honest name for a very honest job. I'll put it on the slate in big letters.
3 playername:nobody => tilda.nameplayer.nobody cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Nobody. Dear, you're somebody to this shop. I'll put it on the slate as 'Somebody'.

addto npc.hazel.talk
3 farmname:meadowbrook => hazel.namefarm.meadowbrook cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Meadowbrook. (It sounds like a book that smells of grass.) A gentle name.
3 farmname:willow => hazel.namefarm.willow cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Willow. (A name that bends and doesn't break.) I'd read that book.
3 farmname:my_farm => hazel.namefarm.my_farm cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: My Farm. (Plain and honest. The best titles never try.)
3 farmname:new_farm => hazel.namefarm.new_farm cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: New Farm. (It's the first line of a long book.) I'd like to see the second.
3 farmname:baa => hazel.namefarm.baa cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Baa. (A farm named after a sheep's whole opinion.) I like it.
3 farmname:the_burrow => hazel.namefarm.the_burrow cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: The Burrow. (Small, warm, and good for hiding with a book.) That's a farm I understand.
3 farmname:untitled => hazel.namefarm.untitled cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Untitled. (The best books start that way. The worst ones stay that way.) I'm hopeful.
3 farmname:lorem_ipsum => hazel.namefarm.lorem_ipsum cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Lorem Ipsum. (A very old, very empty book.) I'd like to fill it for you.
3 farmname:dragon => hazel.namefarm.dragon cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Dragon. (There aren't any in the library.) That's ambitious for a parsnip patch.
3 playername:you => hazel.nameplayer.you cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: You. (A very direct name.) It makes every sentence a little shy.

addto npc.bram.talk
3 farmname:hillside => bram.namefarm.hillside cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Hillside. Hm. Good drainage. Good name.
3 farmname:oakwood => bram.namefarm.oakwood cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Oakwood. Strong. Slow to burn. Good.
3 farmname:beans => bram.namefarm.beans cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Beans. Hm. Short. Good. Easy to say. Hard to improve.
3 farmname:oink => bram.namefarm.oink cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Oink. Hm. Honest. Loud. Fine.
3 farmname:hay => bram.namefarm.hay cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Hay. Hm. Plain. Warm. Good for horses and people.
3 farmname:hoe => bram.namefarm.hoe cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Hoe. Hm. A name and a tool. I approve of both.
3 farmname:dirt => bram.namefarm.dirt cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Dirt. Hm. Where it all begins. Good name.
3 farmname:name => bram.namefarm.name cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Name. Hm. Honest. Lazy. Fine.
3 farmname:nothing => bram.namefarm.nothing cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Nothing. Hm. Bold. Then fill it.
3 playername:me => bram.nameplayer.me cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Me. Hm. Short. Good.

addto npc.juno.talk
3 farmname:home_sweet_home => juno.namefarm.home_sweet_home cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Home Sweet Home! Okay, okay, okay, I want that carved on a gatepost. I'll do the lettering.
3 farmname:honeybee => juno.namefarm.honeybee cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Honeybee! Okay, okay, okay, buzzing is a great work ethic. I'll make you a bee clasp.
3 farmname:potato => juno.namefarm.potato cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Potato! Okay, okay, okay, honest, round and ready for anything. That's me. That's the farm.
3 farmname:bacon => juno.namefarm.bacon cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Bacon! Okay, okay, okay, the smell alone would pay the rent. I'm in.
3 farmname:cluck => juno.namefarm.cluck cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Cluck! Okay, okay, okay, short, loud and a little smug. I'll make you a chicken weathervane.
3 farmname:scarecrow => juno.namefarm.scarecrow cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Scarecrow! Okay, okay, okay, named for the one worker who never complains. Brilliant.
3 farmname:noodle => juno.namefarm.noodle cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Noodle! Okay, okay, okay, wobbly, long and impossible to stop eating. Exactly what a farm should be.
3 farmname:asdf => juno.namefarm.asdf cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Asdf! Okay, okay, okay, keyboard-mashing is a legitimate naming strategy. I once labeled a bucket 'Qwerty'.
3 farmname:bob => juno.namefarm.bob cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Bob! Okay, okay, okay, a farm called Bob. I'm not sure it needs anything else. Bob is enough.
3 farmname:pizza => juno.namefarm.pizza cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Pizza! Okay, okay, okay, nothing's more delightful. I'll show up at dinner.
3 playername:test => juno.nameplayer.test cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Okay, okay, okay, your name's Test. I'm going to treat that as the name of a very proud person.
3 playername:boss => juno.nameplayer.boss cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Boss! Okay, okay, okay, I'll take orders. Mostly the ones that involve labeling.

addto npc.piper.talk
3 farmname:fairview => piper.namefarm.fairview cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Fairview! It rhymes with 'I knew', if you squint. I'll write you a gate song.
3 farmname:riverside => piper.namefarm.riverside cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Riverside. There's no river. That's the kind of honesty I like in a song.
3 farmname:sunflower => piper.namefarm.sunflower cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Sunflower! The best stage light there is, and you can eat it. That's a chorus.
3 farmname:old_macdonald => piper.namefarm.old_macdonald cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Old MacDonald! Had a farm, and so do you! Ee-i-ee-i-o. It's already a chorus.
3 farmname:parsnip => piper.namefarm.parsnip cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Parsnip! I wrote a masterpiece about it. I'll dedicate the second verse to your gate.
3 farmname:moo => piper.namefarm.moo cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Moo! The only farm name that works as a song. 'Moo, moo, moo.' That's a chorus.
3 farmname:hoedown => piper.namefarm.hoedown cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Hoedown! Oh, I'm bringing the fiddle. Wear your heavy boots.
3 farmname:spud_life => piper.namefarm.spud_life cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Spud Life! It's the title of a ballad I haven't written. I'll start tonight.
3 farmname:placeholder => piper.namefarm.placeholder cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Placeholder! The only farm name that promises a better one later. That's a chorus, and a plan.
3 farmname:steve => piper.namefarm.steve cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Steve. That's it, just Steve. I'll write a love song to the fence.
3 farmname:unicorn => piper.namefarm.unicorn cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Unicorn! The most sparkly farm in Wetherell. Do you also have a rainbow, or just manure?
3 playername:bob => piper.nameplayer.bob cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Bob! It rhymes with 'job', and with 'sob', and with 'knob'. A fine name for a verse.
3 playername:chef => piper.nameplayer.chef cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Chef! I'll write you a theme song with a lot of pots in it.

addto npc.wren.talk
3 farmname:clover => wren.namefarm.clover cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Clover! Luck, with a stem. I'll pour you something green on the house. For luck.
3 farmname:daisy => wren.namefarm.daisy cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Daisy! Cheerful, sturdy and slightly bossy. Is that the farm or you?
3 farmname:the_farm => wren.namefarm.the_farm cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: 'The Farm'. Not even a name, just a fact. I admire a farmer who doesn't decorate.
3 farmname:farmy_mcfarmface => wren.namefarm.farmy_mcfarmface cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Farmy McFarmface! Oh, I love it. The whole village will say it with a straight face, and I'll see to that.
3 farmname:turnip => wren.namefarm.turnip cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Turnip! The most dignified root and the funniest word. Wetherell approves.
3 farmname:cabbage_patch => wren.namefarm.cabbage_patch cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: The Cabbage Patch! Where good gossip grows. I'll visit with a very large basket.
3 farmname:cheese => wren.namefarm.cheese cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Cheese! The only farm name that makes every person in the room hungry. Well played.
3 farmname:haystack => wren.namefarm.haystack cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Haystack! Finding anything there is a hard job. I'll be careful with my needles.
3 farmname:mud => wren.namefarm.mud cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Mud! Honest, brown and everywhere. I hope you're prepared for the mat.
3 farmname:banana => wren.namefarm.banana cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Banana! There isn't a single banana in Wetherell. The village is baffled. I'm thrilled.
3 farmname:test => wren.namefarm.test cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: 'Test'! You're testing it. So am I. How's it holding up? Better than the saloon roof.
3 farmname:farm_name => wren.namefarm.farm_name cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: 'Farm Name'! You named your farm 'Farm Name'. I'm laughing so much I've forgotten what I was saying.
3 farmname:everything => wren.namefarm.everything cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Everything! A big name for a farm. I hope the soil keeps up.
3 farmname:the_ranch => wren.namefarm.the_ranch cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: 'The Ranch'. We don't have a ranch. We have a farm. I'm going to pretend I didn't see that.
3 playername:player => wren.nameplayer.player cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Player! Of what? Cards? Pipes? Hearts? I'll assume the first, and then be disappointed gently.
3 playername:steve => wren.nameplayer.steve cat=reactive cooldown=99999 tag=funny :: Steve! The most dependable name there is. I'll save you the good stool.
